   "lines": [
    "Ponies nearly done up,",
    "so made a camp to",
    "stretch hides, dry meat",
    "&c.",
    "An old bull elk,",
    "whistling & calling,",
    "almost came into camp",
    "last night; today I",
    "went off alone on",
    "foot to trail him",
    "up; was absent all",
    "day but never saw",
    "him; shot a rabbit",
    "and a grouse on",
    "the way home. Rubber[?]",
    "wagon sheet makes",
    "pretty good tents[?]."
   ],
